    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are proud to present 14 Brookfield Court, Dartry, Dublin 6, D06 HY59 to the market. A very spacious ground floor apartment c. 1098 sq. ft / 102 sq. m.\r\n\r\nWonderfully proportioned throughout, excellently maintained with south-facing sunroom, 2 bedrooms and set in communal gardens approached through automatic entrance gates. There is a bicycle area and parking.\r\n\r\nBrookfield Court has been refurbished in recent years and is positioned beside Milltown LUAS, shops on Upper Rathmines Road, Rathgar, Rathmines, and Ranelagh villages. Palmerston Park is nearby and there are a number of bus routes close by.\r\n\r\nThe property is within easy reach of the M50, city centre, and Dundrum Town Centre. \r\n\r\nBriefly comprising hall with sliderobes, dining room, lounge, sunroom, kitchen, 2 double bedrooms – main en suite – both with fitted wardrobes. Outside is parking, bicycle area, automatic entrance gates, communal garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nCeiling coving, sliderobes, glazed doors to\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\nCeiling coving\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece, ceiling coving.\r\n\r\nSunroom\r\nWindows to side and rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of high gloss units. Sink unit, partially tiled, Neff extractor, service hatch to dining.\r\nInner Hall\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobes, ceiling coving, en-suite shower, W.C., WHB. Tiled, medicine cabinet, fitted shelved unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobe, ceiling coving.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, power shower, W.C., WHB, tiled, towel radiator.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nCommunal grounds, bicycle area, parking, automatic gates.\r\n\r\nService charge €4,785 per annum subject to review."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 1098 sq. ft./ 102 c. sq. m.\r\nGFCH\r\nD/glazed\r\nAutomatic entrance gates\r\nParking\r\nBeside LUAS, Palmerston Park, shops on Upper Rathmines Road.\r\nBeside Rathgar, Rathmines, Ranelagh villages.\r\nConvenient to M50, city centre, Dundrum Town Centre."
      },
